00:13:07,420 --> 00:13:08,460
I'm so jealous.

287
00:13:10,060 --> 00:13:11,880
I wish I had a western name!

288
00:13:12,100 --> 00:13:12,940
That's why you're jealous?

289
00:13:13,420 --> 00:13:15,380
Maybe I can get it legally changed.

290
00:13:15,700 --> 00:13:17,440
You can't just change your name like that.

291
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:18,900
It'll make grandma really sad.

292
00:13:19,280 --> 00:13:19,960
Oh, yeah.

293
00:13:20,620 --> 00:13:21,140
Morons.

294
00:13:21,560 --> 00:13:21,860
Wait!

295
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:22,780
Osamu!

296
00:13:22,780 --> 00:13:24,520
Samu!

297
00:13:24,520 --> 00:13:24,600
Samu!

298
