299
00:13:27,700 --> 00:13:29,000
These two are weirdos.

300
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:30,440
That's too cool!

301
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:31,640
No, it's not!

302
00:13:33,180 --> 00:13:34,320
Hey there, young man!

303
00:13:34,660 --> 00:13:35,600
My name is Inuhata.

304
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:40,020
