306
00:13:44,420 --> 00:13:45,280
Oh, Setter?

307
00:13:45,540 --> 00:13:47,500
Man, I wanted to see a spiker play.

308
00:13:47,820 --> 00:13:49,500
Ugh, those two are so rude.

309
00:13:50,060 --> 00:13:51,300
Think Jeeba would teach us?

310
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:52,460
Yeah, right, dummy.

311
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:54,680
Come on, don't be stupid.

312
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:56,960
Only the best players get to play Setter.

313
00:13:57,280 --> 00:13:58,900
That's what makes it the coolest position.

314
00:13:59,480 --> 00:14:01,580
So does that mean you want to be a Setter, Salo?

315
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:03,420
No, I want a Spike.

316
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:04,880
What was your point, then?

317
00:14:04,880 --> 00:14:09,940
Wow, nice kill.

318
00:14:10,160 --> 00:14:10,980
That's pretty impressive.

319
00:14:13,340 --> 00:14:15,400
Dude, I hit that last one, like, perfectly.

320
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:16,340
Yeah?

321
00:14:16,880 --> 00:14:18,180
Don't be scared, come on.

322
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:20,620
I'm going to help you get the ball right over.

323
00:14:27,980 --> 00:14:29,740
Whoa, nice job!

324
00:14:33,140 --> 00:14:34,480
We're going to work on this.

325
00:14:34,880 --> 00:14:37,220
Setters...

326
00:14:37,220 --> 00:14:37,420
Hmm?

327
