so what did you expect?

341
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:23,860
But I got the feeling that Atsumu had something that went beyond just that hatred of losing.

342
00:15:23,860 --> 00:15:37,780
But I got the feeling that Atsumu had something that went beyond just that hatred of losing.

343
