376
00:17:27,100 --> 00:17:29,260
Look, we all suck at this game, okay?

377
00:17:29,260 --> 00:17:31,580
That's the whole reason we come in here and practice.

378
00:17:31,580 --> 00:17:32,460
Nice, bad duck.

379
00:17:32,460 --> 00:17:33,660
You're a useless piece of trash.

380
