386
00:17:53,500 --> 00:17:54,220
Damn it.

387
00:17:54,940 --> 00:17:56,940
You abusive, tyrannical pig!

388
00:18:00,220 --> 00:18:04,700
Everybody knows there are times when you might be on your game, but the rest of us just aren't, okay?

389
00:18:05,260 --> 00:18:06,780
Hey, hey, you two, stop it.

390
00:18:07,420 --> 00:18:08,380
Somebody's gonna get hurt.

391
00:18:08,380 --> 00:18:09,500
That's simple, you stupid ass of the guy.

392
00:18:09,500 --> 00:18:10,460
They really don't hold back, do they?

393
00:18:10,460 --> 00:18:11,100
Talk at all.

394
00:18:11,100 --> 00:18:13,740
Does Whittle Atsumu never make any mistakes at all?

395
00:18:15,420 --> 00:18:18,380
What's wrong with calling a piece of trash a piece of trash?

396
00:18:18,380 --> 00:18:20,060
Look in the mirror, some type dumpster.

397
00:18:20,060 --> 00:18:22,220
