Yeah.

404
00:18:43,740 --> 00:18:45,340
Slow down, you stupid idiots!

405
00:18:45,340 --> 00:18:53,440
If you ask me, the biggest blessing Atsumu has isn't his physique, or even any of his various talents.

406
00:18:54,200 --> 00:18:55,600
It's actually Osamu.

407
00:18:56,640 --> 00:19:02,840
No matter how fast the two of them run, if no one else can catch up, they will always catch up with each other.

408
00:19:04,760 --> 00:19:06,800
I'm sure that can be annoying sometimes.

409
00:19:10,460 --> 00:19:12,120
Come back here, you scrub!

410
00:19:12,120 --> 00:19:17,220
But the more they compete with each other, the stronger they get.

411
00:19:19,300 --> 00:19:22,600
All Japan youth intensive, eh? Not bad, Sumo.

412
00:19:22,860 --> 00:19:24,520
You should be more upset, Samu!

413
00:19:24,840 --> 00:19:29,920
I am, you dumbass. I'm upset at the fact that I'm not more upset about it, honestly.

414
00:19:32,500 --> 00:19:34,640
You've been working hard your whole life, Sumo.

415
00:19:35,180 --> 00:19:39,580
What the hell? You'd better not be telling me you haven't been working this whole damn time!

416
00:19:39,580 --> 00:19:42,460
I think they wanted someone like you.

417
00:19:43,020 --> 00:19:45,800
Someone who is a hard worker and is a little bit crazy.

418
