442
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:20,120
So?

443
00:21:20,120 --> 00:21:23,520
So, underhand, I only have my two arms.

444
00:21:24,200 --> 00:21:25,880
Overhand, I've got ten fingers.

445
00:21:26,840 --> 00:21:29,280
I want the most contact points to get better support.

446
00:21:29,820 --> 00:21:30,940
Cause I'm a setter!

447
00:21:34,740 --> 00:21:36,240
That's Atsumumiya for ya.

448
00:21:36,460 --> 00:21:40,420
He may be something of a goof, and sometimes he can be stubborn and overbearing.

449
